<title>USA: Rayonier Timberlands sets qtly distribution.</title>
<headline>Rayonier Timberlands sets qtly distribution.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rayonier Timberlands LP said it set a quarterly distribution on its class A unit.</p>
<p>					Quarterly</p>
<p>			  Latest		     Prior</p>
<p> Amount		  $1.70		     $1.33</p>
<p> Pay		  March 31</p>
<p> Record		 Feb 28</p>
<p>Note: Full name of the company is Rayonier Timberlands LP</p>
</text>
